Each duck eats 3.5 pounds of insects per week. There are ten ducks. So, the total amount of insects needed per week is 10 * 3.5 pounds = 35 pounds. We want to find out how many pounds of insects are needed per day. There are 7 days in a week. So, the amount of insects needed per day is 35 pounds / 7 days = 5 pounds per day.

\boxed{5}
